This product is derived from "Phone Whisper" by Pol Alvarez
(https://github.com/kafkasl/phone-whisper), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Changes include: removal of cloud transcription and cleanup, a redesigned interface, a larger on-device model
catalogue with install/uninstall, voice-activity detection, offline text cleanup, history, language selection,
trigger modes, and reliability work on the floating bubble.

Third-party components:
- sherpa-onnx (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx), Apache-2.0: Kotlin API sources in
  app/src/main/kotlin/com/k2fsa/sherpa/onnx and the prebuilt native libraries fetched by tools/fetch-native-libs.sh.
- Silero VAD (https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad), MIT: app/src/main/assets/silero_vad.onnx.
- ONNX Runtime (https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime), MIT: bundled inside the native libraries.

Speech models are downloaded by the user at runtime and are not part of this repository. Each model has its own
licence; check it before redistributing a model.

The app icon was generated with an AI image model and processed locally.
